["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">電報</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">でんぽう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">电报</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"162168\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>電報<rp>(</rp><rt>でんぽう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I received a telegram from her.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">都</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">と</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">东京都；（城镇的计量单位）；首都；京城</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">とうとう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">终于；最后；最终；到底</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200035\">トムはとうとうタバコをやめた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Tom finally gave up smoking.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遠く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">远处；远方；远地；遥远的地方；很久以前；很久以后；遥远的过去；遥远的未来；远远地；远比</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"188692\"><ruby>遠<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くにぼんやりした<ruby>明<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かりが<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We saw a dim light in the distance.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">经过；通过；沿着；取道；走（某条路）；运行；运营；开通（交通线路）；进屋；入室；被准许进入；被引进；穿透；刺穿；贯穿；透过；渗透；浸透；遍及；传播；传达（如声音）；远达；转达；转告；被传达（如顾客的订单）；通过；批准；获准；被接受；以...的名义为人所知；被认可为；享有...的声誉；连贯；合理；有逻辑；易懂；讲得通；被理解；表达清楚；看起来像；显得；给人...的印象；笔直；（如木纹）顺直；见多识广；睿智；彻底完成；充分地做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91569\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はベスという<ruby>名<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She went by the name of Bess.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">特に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とくに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">特别；尤其；格外；特意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158186\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>音楽<rp>(</rp><rt>おんがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>特<rp>(</rp><rt>とく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にロックが<ruby>大好<rp>(</rp><rt>だいす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I love music, especially rock.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">特別</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とくべつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">特别；特殊；非凡；例外的；格外的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123440\"><ruby>特別<rp>(</rp><rt>とくべつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>料理<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がございますが。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We have something special for you, sir.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">とこや</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">理发店；理发师</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">途中</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とちゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">路上；途中；中途；半路；中间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124585\"><ruby>途中<rp>(</rp><rt>とちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>であきらめるな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Don&#x27;t give up halfway.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">特急</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とっきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">特快列车（需要购买特快车票的列车）；特快列车（停靠站数有限的列车）；火急；紧急</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150518\"><ruby>時計<rp>(</rp><rt>とけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がおくれていたので、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>特急<rp>(</rp><rt>とっきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にのりそこねた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">As my watch was slow, I missed the special express.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:届く\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">届く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とどく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">送到；到达</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>昨日<rp>(</rp><rt>きのう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>荷物<rp>(</rp><rt>にもつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>届<rp>(</rp><rt>とど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">昨天包裹送到了。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">届ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とどける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">递送；转交；发送；报告；通知；报备；登记</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187063\"><ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>届<rp>(</rp><rt>とど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けていただけますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Can you deliver it to my house?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">泊まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">住宿；投宿；停泊；系泊；靠泊</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155487\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>先週<rp>(</rp><rt>せんしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>おじの<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>泊<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まりました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I stayed with my uncle last week.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">止める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">停止；关闭；停放；泊车；阻止；抑制（咳嗽）；忍住（泪水）；屏住（呼吸）；缓解（疼痛）；阻止；劝阻；禁止；注意到；意识到；集中于；留意；记住；牢记；固定；系牢；钉住；别上；扣上；订合；拘留；扣押</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192310\">ロイはそのメダルをピンで<ruby>止<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Roy fastened the medal with a pin.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り替える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりかえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">交换；互换；掉换；兑换；替换；更换；代替</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217626\">これを<ruby>青<rp>(</rp><rt>あお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いのと<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>替<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please change this for a blue one.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">道具</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">工具；器具；用具；装置；设备；手段；家具</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144319\"><ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつ<ruby>道具<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めたのか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">When did man start to use tools?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動物園</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうぶつえん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">动物园；动物园林</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217495\">コンドルは<ruby>動物園<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぶつえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>育<rp>(</rp><rt>そだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Condors have never bred in zoos.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">泥棒</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どろぼう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">小偷；盗贼；抢劫犯；偷窃；盗窃；抢劫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213632\">そこの<ruby>乞食<rp>(</rp><rt>こじき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>泥棒<rp>(</rp><rt>どろぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がわかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The beggar turned out to be a thief.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どんどん</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">咚咚声；击鼓声；敲打声；砰砰声；迅速地；快速地；稳定地；连续地；一个接一个地；接连不断地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203241\">だれかがドアをどんどんたたいている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Someone is battering at the door.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">直す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なおす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">修理；修补；修好；改正；纠正；恢复；整理；振作；改变；转换；翻译；放回；收起；治疗；医治；升职；晋升；重做；再做一遍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199216\">なぜヒューズを<ruby>直<rp>(</rp><rt>なお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さないのですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Why don&#x27;t you mend that fuse?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">治る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なおる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（病等）痊愈；恢复；康复；治愈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150179\"><ruby>治<rp>(</rp><rt>なお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るのにしばらくかかりますね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It will take a while to go away.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">直る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なおる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">被修理；被修好；被修复；恢复正常；康复；恢复；改善；好转；恢复如初；被改正；被纠正；被整正；自愈；治愈；坐直；坐端正；被提升；升职；罪行被赦免；获得宽恕</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228942\">いったい、いつになったらそのケチは<ruby>直<rp>(</rp><rt>なお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るの？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">When will you ever loosen your purse strings?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">中々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なかなか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">非常；相当；颇为；很；轻易；容易；绝非；不易；难以；中间；中点；优秀；出色；很好</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229495\">アンはなかなかやって<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Ann was long coming.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">泣く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">哭泣；流泪；啜泣；遭受苦难；为…所困扰；经历艰辛；勉强接受（无理要求、损失等）；忍痛承担；做出牺牲；有负盛名；声誉受损；蒙羞；哀叹；悲叹；痛惜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197338\">ビルは<ruby>何時間<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>泣<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>続<rp>(</rp><rt>つづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Bill kept on crying for hours.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">亡くなる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なくなる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">死亡；去世；逝世</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84844\"><ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>ちち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>亡<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなってから３<ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>ねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">My father has been dead for three years.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">無くなる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なくなる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">丢失；遗失；不见了；用完；耗尽；消耗殆尽；没有了；消失；隐没；消退</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233128\">あなたの<ruby>青<rp>(</rp><rt>あお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いペンがなくなってしまいました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I misplaced your blue pen.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">投げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">投掷；抛；扔；甩；放弃；抛弃；丢弃；投射；投出（目光、影子、怀疑等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210222\">その<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>石<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>投<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That child threw a stone at the dog.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なさる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">做；干；进行</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214623\">ステーキの<ruby>焼<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどうなさいますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How would you like your steak?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">鳴る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">发出声音；鸣响；回响；呼啸；隆隆作响</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124735\"><ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>鳴<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったらただちに<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">When the telephone rings, you must answer right away.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なるべく</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尽可能地；尽量；如果可能的话</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199061\">なるべく<ruby>安<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いほうがいいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I would like the least expensive one.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なるほど</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">我明白了；原来如此；确实；正是</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"9611877\">ああ、なるほど！</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Ah, gotcha!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">慣れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">习惯</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>日本<rp>(</rp><rt>にほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>生活<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもう<ruby>慣<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">已经习惯日本的生活了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">におい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">气味；臭味；香气；气息；迹象；风味；氛围；日本刀刃纹上沿淬火线的淡雾状纹理</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231152\">あの<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はにおいが<ruby>強<rp>(</rp><rt>つよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That flower has a powerful smell.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">二階建て</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にかいだて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">两层楼房；二层建筑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">苦的；苦味的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223800\">このコーヒーは<ruby>苦<rp>(</rp><rt>にが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>味<rp>(</rp><rt>あじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This coffee tastes bitter.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">逃げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">逃跑；逃离；逃脱；躲避；冲出；躲藏；回避；逃避；躲闪；推卸；退缩；领先获胜；坚持领先到终点；保持领先；逸出；泄漏；散发；消失（指热、气体、香气等）；姿势不稳；身体失去平衡</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174871\"><ruby>現実<rp>(</rp><rt>げんじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>逃<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げることはできない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You can&#x27;t escape from reality.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日記</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にっき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">日记；日志</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92605\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそのことを<ruby>日記<rp>(</rp><rt>にっき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She wrote about it in her diary.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">入院</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にゅういん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">住院</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">院</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">入学</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にゅうがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">入学；入学登记；注册</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">似る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">相似；相像；像；相近；酷似</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236771\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>似<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたことがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I also heard a similar story.</span></div></li>"]